## Overview
Comprehensive annotation and bookmark system for LitLyric's ebook reader (v0.6.1+). Supports both EPUB (CFI-based) and PDF (page-based) positioning with full AudioBookShelf synchronization.

## Features
- ✅ **EPUB Annotations** - CFI-based positioning compatible with Readium
- ✅ **PDF Annotations** - Page-based positioning for PDF files  
- ✅ **Rich Highlights** - Customizable colors and text selection
- ✅ **Notes & Bookmarks** - Standalone notes and position markers
- ✅ **AudioBookShelf Sync** - Export/import for server synchronization
- ✅ **User Isolation** - Proper multi-user support
- ✅ **REST API** - Ready for Android integration

